---
title: Route selection, pin, attempt admission and cooldown (implemented)
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Caller as Session or host pipeline
  participant R as InferenceRouter
  participant CD as ConnectionDirectory (ConnectionService)
  participant Store as WriteTransaction (router, usage, history)
  participant P as NativeProviders (source and sink)
  participant H as StreamingHttp
  Caller->>R: router.route(session, intent Tier or Model, effort, capabilities)
  R->>R: Need.parse (unknown label refused)
  R->>CD: connections(RouterRead)
  R->>Store: session pin, cooldowns, tier members, catalog rows
  alt pin still eligible for intent, effort and need
    R-->>Caller: Kept (or rewritten with new capability labels or connection)
  else pool assessed by select.assess
    R->>R: eligible = no Block (Disabled, NoConnection, NotAllowed, Cooling ...)
    alt none eligible
      R-->>Caller: refusal with block codes (Unavailable, earliest cooldown)
    else Tier intent
      R->>Store: tier_cursor then advance (round robin among eligible)
      R->>Store: write RoutePinned (compare and set, reason Initial, Failover ...)
    else Model intent
      R->>Store: write pin for the first eligible
    end
  end
  Caller->>R: admit_request(RequestAdmission) records intent in the operation journal
  Caller->>R: admit_attempt(AttemptSelection)
  R->>R: attempt_route_current rechecks pool, capability and connection
  alt route changed since selection
    R-->>Caller: Admission SourceChanged (a retry may select another eligible route)
  else still current
    R->>Store: Admitted attempt (mark_attempt_dispatched rechecks again)
  end
  Caller->>P: drive(source, sink)
  P->>CD: access(connection) only at dispatch
  P->>H: open(request, StreamLimits, Cancellation)
  H-->>P: response head and stream
  alt HTTP 403, or 401 on a non-OAuth credential
    P->>Store: record_inference_rejection (connection needs sign-in)
  end
  alt HTTP 429 or exhausted limit with a reset time
    P->>Store: record_cooldown(model, until, RateLimited)
    Note over R,Store: the next route() and admit_attempt skip the cooling model
  end
